  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "id" : 180,
    "page number" : 7,
    "bounding box" : [ 50.4, 886.421, 561.526, 923.36 ],
    "font" : "LucidaSansUnicode",
    "font size" : 12.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.502]",
    "content" : "a visionary city. For this the shareholders looked at Paris at the turn of the century. Paris has always been viewed as a “Global City” with a visionary urban environment."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "id" : 181,
    "page number" : 7,
    "bounding box" : [ 50.4, 788.261, 561.616, 880.38 ],
    "font" : "LucidaSansUnicode",
    "font size" : 12.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.502]",
    "content" : "After much thought and analysis, it was decide that the Fort Bonifacio masterplan would employ an innovative development approach, but would utilize visionary elements in the land scaping and environmental design of the city. The resulting city would eventually become the country’s business nucleus as well as gaining the reputation of being the region’s best city."
